WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
Can you tell me a little bit more about your journey?

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.180
I've been here 10 years.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.220
I'm a proud American citizen.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:06.940
I'm a dual national.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:07.440
I'm British.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.500
I'm American.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.140
And I am an immigrant who's contributing to this country.

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:15.260
So yes, I'm very much proud of America's immigrant heritage.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.260
I'm part of it.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.500
And despite what one of the other people

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.459
said on the show earlier, yeah, everyone here,

00:00:20.459 --> 00:00:22.219
unless you're Native American, is a descendant of immigrants.

00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:22.860
All right, pause.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.100
Sorry, you've been voted out.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.260
Please return to your seat.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:25.620
Thank you, ma'am.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.299
Nice to meet you.

00:00:26.299 --> 00:00:27.059
Nice to meet you.

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:30.400
Beep, beep, beep, beep.

